---
permalink: /manifest.webmanifest
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{
  "name": "JavaZone 2026 — program",
  "short_name": "JavaZone",
  "description": "Programmet for JavaZone 2026 på NOVA Spektrum, Lillestrøm.",
  "lang": "no",
  "start_url": "{{ '/' | url }}",
  "scope": "{{ '/' | url }}",
  "display": "standalone",
  "orientation": "portrait-primary",
  "background_color": "#0a2747",
  "theme_color": "#153863",
  {#- No "sizes": "any" entry any more. It was there so an installer wanting a
      size nobody listed could render one at whatever resolution it liked, and
      the mark is a raster mascot now, so there is nothing left to render from.
      512 takes over that role: it is the largest size anything here is asked
      for - the install prompt's own artwork and the splash screen - and every
      launcher size below it is a downscale of it, which is what an installer
      would have done with the vector anyway. #}
  "icons": [
    { "src": "{{ '/icons/icon-192.png' | url }}", "sizes": "192x192", "type": "image/png" },
    { "src": "{{ '/icons/icon-512.png' | url }}", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png" },
    { "src": "{{ '/icons/icon-maskable-512.png' | url }}", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "maskable" }
  ]
}
